# Scope: only the Beat-Ding / fairness-vs-Ding comparison stack is tracked from this huge agents/ tree.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/BEAT_DING
!/CESEL
!/CESEL_MA
!/CES_FL
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/ces_fl/
!/CLIPFAIR
!/DEMO_AXES
!/FAIRREL_REPRO
!/DINGREPRO_LIN
!/README.md
!/decisions
!/decisions/**

# Within tracked dirs: code/config/docs only, never checkpoints, caches, raw outputs or locks.
**/runs/
**/runs_*/
**/results/**/*.npz
**/logs/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.npz
**/*.RUNLOCK*
**/*.bak*
**/*.xc_wip*
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/pretrained/
**/Ding_mod/pretrained/
**/outputs/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# raw image/data dumps accidentally present under some agent dirs
**/data/extracted/
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.png
**/*.bmp
**/*.webp
**/work/
